# Profile-guided build of the interpreter Portage and every Python tool run on.
# Measured on the host 2026-11-20: emerge -pe @world 18.7 s -> 17.5 s (about 6-7 %),
# same merge list. Build cost: a few minutes per slot (the profile run is a
# subset of the test suite). Cross profiles cannot use it: the profile run
# executes the freshly built target interpreter.
dev-lang/python pgo
